<tr class="spaceNote" id="${idProjectHint}" style="display: none">
  <td colspan="2">
    <div class="attentionComment">
      A <strong>project connection</strong> is bound to the scope of exactly one Space project.<br/>
      For this purpose an <em>organization connection</em>'s Space application is used to create a dedicated
      sub application and to request the appropriate rights.
    </div>
  </td>
</tr>